  "common-default-rails/sine": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: kind_not_allowed M1\n* issue: value_out_of_range R1\n* issue: floating_pin x.C\n* issue: floating_pin x.B\n* issue: value_out_of_range U1\n* issue: floating_pin U1.1\n* issue: floating_pin U1.2\n* issue: duplicate_name U1\n* issue: value_out_of_range U1\n* issue: floating_pin U1.A\n* issue: value_out_of_range Q1\n* issue: duplicate_name x\n* issue: floating_pin x.C\n* issue: dangling_wire w1\n* issue: dangling_wire w2\nCR1 0 0 1e+3\nQx n1 n2 0 QNPN\nLU1 n3 n4 1e+20\nDU1 n5 0 DZ_DU1\nCQ1 0 0 1e+3\nQx2 n6 0 0 QPNP\n.model DZ_DU1 D(IS=1e-14 BV=1e-7 IBV=1e-3)\n.model QNPN NPN(BF=100)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\nVin in 0 SIN(5e-1 1e+0 1e+3)\nRload out outl 1e+12\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 5e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
